      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "41 Gleann Tuarigh, Youghal, Co. Cork, P36 H330\r\n\r\nDNG Spillane are delighted to present No. 41 Gleann Tuarigh to the market, a three-bedroom, three-bathroom semi-detached home situated within this popular and established residential development on the outskirts of Youghal town.\r\n\r\nExtending to approximately 82 sq. metres, the property offers a practical layout ideally suited to first-time buyers, families, investors or those seeking a conveniently located home within easy reach of Youghal town and the surrounding coastline.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation begins with an entrance hallway leading to the living room at the front of the property. To the rear is the kitchen/dining room, which provides space for everyday dining and has direct access to the enclosed rear garden. A guest W.C. completes the ground-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nOn the first floor there are three bedrooms, with the main bedroom benefiting from an en-suite shower room. A separate family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms and completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nExternally, the property benefits from off-street parking to the front and a fully enclosed private garden to the rear. A particularly useful feature is the large steel shed, which has both power and water connected, providing excellent additional storage or workspace. A separate timber garden shed is also included in the sale.\r\n\r\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating together with a B energy rating.\r\n\r\nGleann Tuarigh is a well-established residential development conveniently located within easy reach of Youghal town and its extensive range of amenities, including schools, shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants and sporting facilities.\r\n\r\nYoughal's coastline is also close by, with a choice of beaches, coastal walks and recreational amenities within easy reach. Cork City is approximately 40 minutes away by car, making the property a practical option for those commuting to Cork City and throughout the wider East Cork area.\r\n\r\nNo. 41 Gleann Tuarigh represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom home in a convenient residential location, with the added benefits of a B energy rating, off-street parking, private rear garden and substantial external storage.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended through sole selling agents DNG Spillane."
      },
      {
